{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1000_p", "source_sha256": "dee2255cb86921df58c60be2cc8edcd3a4ace99b35b793a38610d2cf16ac585f", "ja": "（響の新しい衣装、いろいろ挑戦だったけど……。\n思った通り、カッコよく決まってるな！）", "zh": "（响的新服装虽然是各种意义上的挑战……\n不过正如我所想，穿在她身上果然很帅气！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "cfa131800d58b63ff926322be093a1994cffe8990da45c9d6959456f732ef866", "ja": "うう、{$P$}、\nなんてことしてくれたんだ～……。", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}，\n你都干了些什么好事呀～……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1002_p", "source_sha256": "5ae7d7c1baf46c98925e8a9959cd86e5cee091b85da61f074a6a6754624e7e78", "ja": "えっ？　どういうことだ？\nカンペキに似合ってると思ったのに……！？", "zh": "诶？这是什么意思？\n我明明觉得非常合适的……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "4b72bdf50b0fab3d37b6695e1e4577229e471576d0779d8e8010650cd5748ec6", "ja": "当たり前でしょ！\nだから大変なんだってばー！", "zh": "那当然啦！\n所以才糟糕啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1e5ae0e54c4a86766665fd469159d2299674c48d6d2f4189455420fd35c963d2", "ja": "……少し、説明してくれないか。", "zh": "……能不能稍微跟我解释一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "5ae5324cceb728ed8cb9bd115afc54dbc6e9859caeaac7dd58d10f8064cd722e", "ja": "もう……今回だけ、特別だぞ。", "zh": "真是的……就仅限这次，算破例哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "9842121b8957f9733845718dd132f2a246c36474acbe0fd71d2989670bc9d429", "ja": "この衣装、すっごくカッコよく決まってるから、\n着て立ってるだけでイイ感じになっちゃうでしょ？", "zh": "这套服装已经帅气十足了，所以只要穿上站在那里，就会显得很有感觉，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "b3f1232bb3b6d8f89384dce1d534731e2f599e282f57767c9c39d88bdbc770e8", "ja": "さらにカッコよく見せるために、自分は……自分は……\nうううっ、一体どうすればいいんだ～！？", "zh": "为了让自己看起来更帅气，我……我……\n呜呜呜，到底该怎么办才好啊——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4a5dec37d4d9943b271e68e868d51d76d7ecfb733e1c5d9ad39705e36d8cf4e4", "ja": "……つまり、衣装のカッコよさに\n負けそうってことか。", "zh": "……也就是说，你担心自己\n会输给服装的帅气吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e0ced6f83cbb98c933a4908b80de51e7e7f011b9401580c617120172e4e3c317", "ja": "大丈夫。たしかにそれはスタイリッシュでインパクトも\n強い、超カンペキな衣装だけど、響は負けない。", "zh": "没事的。那件服装确实又帅气又有冲击力，\n堪称超完美，但响不会输的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ffbce1443863c811722b636c6931f7ad67fd38ea7151a2a9e61d825a075af2c7", "ja": "なぜなら響のカッコよさは、生命を宿している！\nポテンシャルは、その遥か上をいくはずだ！", "zh": "因为响的帅气，是有生命的！\n潜力一定远在那之上！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "2801bce4567de68cc1c00c4c1d1ab0003fd610497b58dace972af7db37e21399", "ja": "！！　そ、そっか。\nたしかに、自分は生きてる……！！", "zh": "！！这、这样啊。\n确实，我还活着……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "d7e9e2d112b7da497e128310e1ef2a5b963e0beee4cb0483e4a11c7f4f52dc8c", "ja": "って、なんか適当なこと言って\nごまかそうとしてないか？", "zh": "你这是在随口敷衍，想蒙混过去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e5700a941f9adff8c05d6fc548499bb295990d3d09bbca1b3ab0154dabe72067", "ja": "してないよ？", "zh": "没有啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ee39c0df289918ab08e8a136cd7d03808d419b287c150c73bbf1ff210f945ccb", "ja": "でも……、なんかごめんな。\nそんなに悩むとは思わなかった。", "zh": "不过……总觉得有点对不起你。\n没想到会让你这么烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "63cac21ebd27027d4a59adc058454ebd42f5deea5fc4a4738c213218fefd278e", "ja": "……ううん、謝るのは自分の方だぞ。\nそれくらい、衣装がカッコよかったってことだし。", "zh": "……不，该道歉的是我才对啦。\n这正说明那套服装有多帅气嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1016_013hib", "source_sha256": "bf865f67bf67c83f3213c6d207086b9bf82093abb9239a844b95f0689520c87b", "ja": "でも、もう大丈夫！　おかげで今は自分、\nすっごく燃えてきたから！", "zh": "不过，已经没事了！多亏了你，现在我已经彻底燃起来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1017_p", "source_sha256": "9f3aa5e3382f2a16db018bbb71e77cb8d0db274acc4a80353529474389045dc9", "ja": "おお、さすが響だ。\nそうこなくっちゃな！", "zh": "哦，不愧是响。\n就该这样才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "b15abcc23a5abd526e9753602b685296c43f149f5121f00dc0f04f3c5624cadc", "ja": "要するに、この衣装は{$P$}から\n自分への挑戦状みたいなものってことだよね。", "zh": "也就是说，这套衣装就像是{$P$}给自己的挑战书，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "842f4dd53085ef41cc1740c498c04e2214dcbcd723130a05487b7701815a3894", "ja": "受けて立つぞ！　カンペキな衣装に負けない、\nカンペキなパフォーマンス、期待してて！", "zh": "我接下了！期待我拿出不输给这套完美服装的完美表现吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1020_p", "source_sha256": "96fbef45855c43f7c956e366236b02b9e86c3eea92653de0d67748de91917286", "ja": "（響の闘争心に火をつけてしまったみたいだ……）", "zh": "（好像点燃了响的斗志……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "df9d77d1c0b4da8318a65644dc6067e88c2cab40307cf9b599438dee94ee317a", "ja": "ねえねえ。動きとか確認してみたいんだけど、\nレッスンルーム、今から使ってもいい？", "zh": "那个……我想确认一下动作什么的，\n现在可以用练习室吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1022_p", "source_sha256": "4bc7d34993f287ad198cc450b6e92b01aa815d66e4b7d7d77e60b689e4470b2e", "ja": "もちろん。\n汚したり破いたりしないよう、気を付けてな。", "zh": "当然可以。\n注意别弄脏或弄破了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "a3f7ebd88386748d5bf25fd6f94890c2289198a4341d8a65d55053f93da38563", "ja": "わかってるってば。もっと自分を信用していいのに……\nあ、忘れてた。", "zh": "我知道啦。明明可以再相信自己一点的……\n啊，我忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_013hib0444_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_013hib0444_1024_013hib", "source_sha256": "5ab92f9a46ed94bc1b35196ab46b25e7a6b291060796938489f0f606bd8f4f86", "ja": "衣装、ホントにありがとね！", "zh": "衣装，真的谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
